  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "json_string_unescape: handle invalid bytes 0x80-b9",
  "description": "Bytes between 0x80 and 0xb9 were falsely being treated as valid\nsingle-character values for a UTF-8 string in JSON. This addresses that\nby inserting a replacement character when such a byte appears.\n\nCloses #18452",
  "state": "closed",
