          "id": 1132162788,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "As originally written, this limits `output_string_buffer` to a hard upper limit of the same number of bytes as the input token. That led to truncation if an invalid byte was found, because the unicode replacement character U+FFFD takes three bytes in UTF-8 representation.",
