        {
          "id": 1134409001,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I can (and will when I get the chance), but I don't see these as two separate issues. The fuzz crash was caused by JSON containing falsely-marked valid characters, and the crash is technically fixed by the `ws_utf8_char_len()` fix, but without the \"enhancement\" the JSON dissector exits early without decoding the full string. IMHO that's still buggy behaviour.",
