      "title": "json_string_unescape: handle invalid bytes 0x80-b9",
      "message": "json_string_unescape: handle invalid bytes 0x80-b9\n\nBytes between 0x80 and 0xb9 were falsely being treated as valid\nsingle-character values for a UTF-8 string in JSON. This addresses that\nby inserting a replacement character when such a byte appears.\n",
